<h2>How the Combine Numbers Predicted the Career</h2>
<div class="rank-card">
<div class="rank-title">Chubb's Combine Profile vs His 8-Year Career Result</div>
<div class="rank-row">
<div class="rank-label"><strong>40-Yard Dash</strong>4.52s</div>
<div class="rank-track"><div class="rank-fill" style="width:78%;background:#aaff00"></div></div>
