<div class="faq-item">
<div class="faq-q">Is Nick Chubb a Hall of Fame running back?</div>
<div class="faq-a">His case is genuinely debated. Chubb's per-carry efficiency (5.03 yards per attempt on 1,462 carries) ranks among the best of any back in NFL history, but injuries shortened his prime compared to the longer statistical resumes of automatic Hall of Fame runners.</div>
</div>
